        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fibreboard soft, at plant (u=7%)
140 kg/m3;
UUID: 5e42b628-34b1-3eb8-8871-f2b334776018
includes all inputs to the production processes, transport, wastes and emissions to air and water; does not include any packaging material
Location: representative for Swiss production and Swiss consumption
Technology: wet process, medium enterprise technology (2008)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: plant data 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: highly representative data with generally low uncertainty. Uncertainty related to emissions into water and related to two proxy processes related to heat production exist.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5e42b628-34b1-3eb8-8871-f2b334776018.xml</text>
